<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Colourbeam</h1>
<p>Sphere: Mind Sphere
Class: Healer (guild level 45)
Mana: 24
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast colourbeam &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast colourbeam</a>   (at whoever you are fighting)
</pre>
<p>The second of the colour spells, stronger than flash: a beam of searing 
colours strikes the target's mind. The better your divine power and your skill 
in the spell, the more it hurts. It hurts most through clothes and least 
through plate, which takes about a third less. A shield takes some of it, 
but can't stop it.
</p><p>Casting it is an attack and starts a fight. It can be cast while fighting. 
It is also found on staffs, wands and scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
